WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.190
Time to have a go.

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:05.230
You only need a phone
and about ten minutes.

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:06.950
Pick one app.

00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:12.390
ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude,
Copilot or Amazon Quick.

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:16.150
They all work much the same
way, so use the one you like.

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:19.720
Download the app from your
app store, and sign in.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:24.560
At the bottom of the screen there's a box
that says something like Ask anything,

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:26.240
and a little microphone.

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:28.930
You can type, or you can talk.

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:31.210
Start with a real job.

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:34.223
Give it the who, the what and the when.

00:00:34.243 --> 00:00:35.610
Something like this.

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:38.530
Write a short text to
my shearing contractor.

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:42.380
We've got two thousand ewes near Kurow,
and we'd like the second week of

00:00:42.590 --> 00:00:43.580
December.

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:48.200
Read what comes back.

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:51.960
If it's not quite right, just
tell it, like you would a person.

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:54.360
Make it shorter and less formal.

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:58.250
Or, add that the woolshed
power is fixed now.

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:05.390
If it gets a detail wrong, say so plainly.

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:08.350
No, it's December, not November.

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:11.040
It fixes it and carries on.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:15.820
There's no magic wording.

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:19.390
Talk to it the way you'd brief
someone new on the farm.

00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:24.630
It remembers what you've
said so far in that chat.

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:25.670
New job?

00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:28.737
Start a fresh chat with
the plus or pencil icon,

00:01:28.757 --> 00:01:31.640
so the old details don't get mixed in.

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:34.800
Talking works well in
the ute or the yards.

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:37.440
Most apps have a voice
mode where you just talk,

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:39.040
and it talks back.

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:43.680
In the ute, ChatGPT works
hands-free through Apple CarPlay.

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:46.130
Or pop your phone in a cradle.

00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:48.650
One rule before you start.

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:52.890
Don't put in anything you wouldn't
put in an email to a stranger.

00:01:52.910 --> 00:01:56.220
Bank details, passwords, people's personal

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:57.130
information.

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:58.940
Leave them out.

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:03.620
Below the video there's a card
with five first questions to try.

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:08.630
Pick one, have a go, and see what it
does with a real job from your week.
